<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Multiple training modules can be configured and assigned.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>AC-14</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can specify the scope of training based on specific user actions (=
e.g., clicking on phishing payloads).</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can set user-specific scopes for training (e.g., employees who cli=
cked on payloads).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>AC-15</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can choose to hide or display advanced options for configuring tra=
ining.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can toggle advanced options on and off.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>AC-16</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can review the training module preview before finalizing selection=
.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can preview the training content to ensure it meets requirements.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>AC-17</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can assign the training based on predefined criteria (e.g., depart=
ment, risk level).</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can filter and assign training based on department or user group.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>AC-18</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can sort training modules based on popularity, difficulty, or cate=
gory.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can see training modules sorted as per their selected criteria.</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>AC-19</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can specify the number of days until training is due as a required=
 input.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can select the number of days for training completion.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>AC-20</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can successfully proceed to the next step in the campaign setup af=
ter completing the training module selection.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can move to the next step once all modules are selected and valida=
ted.</p></td>
</tr>
