</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>System Behavior &amp; Validation</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Training Language Selection</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Admin can select a language from the dropdown list, with English as the =
default language.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Assignment Type Selection</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Admin selects the assignment method from the dropdown:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Assign All</strong>: All selected trainings will be assigned.</p=
></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Intelligently Assign</strong>: One module is intelligently assig=
ned based on data.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Training Module Selection</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Admin can select one or more training modules from a list.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The list should support filtering, sorting by popularity, and searching =
by keyword.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Admin can preview the training modules before finalizing the selection.<=
/p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Filter Modal Behavior</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Admin clicks the Filter button to show the filter modal.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Training Language and Assignments can be selected.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Days Until Due is configurable to specify when the training should be du=
e.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Admin can select a Training Scope to specify the target audience of the =
campaign (e.g., employees who clicked on payloads or were compromised).</p>=
</li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Validation</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The system ensures that at least one training module is selected before =
proceeding.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The system checks the validity of the selected training language, assign=
ment method, and training scope.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Business Rules</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
