<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Special Scenario for "Simulated Phishing &amp; Security Awarenes=
s Training"</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If the Admin selects <strong>Simulated Phishing &amp; Security Awareness=
 Training</strong> during the campaign setup:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>After selecting the training modules, the system will detect if <strong>=
Simulated Phishing &amp; Security Awareness Training</strong> has been sele=
cted.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The system will then prompt the Admin to proceed to the next step, where=
 the modules will be applied accordingly for the selected audience.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>The training content will be tailored according to the chosen simulated =
phishing scenarios, and the system will enable the Admin to review the fina=
lized setup.</p></li>
</ol></li>
